warning[format_push_string]: `tprint` formats into a new string just to append it to a builder
  --> tests/lint/format_push_string/bad.jai:8:5
   |
 8 |     append(*builder, tprint("%: %\n", name, value));
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: `print_to_builder` writes into the builder directly
   |
 8 ~     print_to_builder(*builder, "%: %\n", name, value);
   |
   = note: `format_push_string` is `warn` by default

warning[format_push_string]: `sprint` formats into a new string just to append it to a builder
  --> tests/lint/format_push_string/bad.jai:14:5
   |
14 |     append(*builder, sprint("[%]", name));
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: `print_to_builder` writes into the builder directly, and the string `sprint` returns is never freed here
   |
14 ~     print_to_builder(*builder, "[%]", name);
   |
   = note: `format_push_string` is `warn` by default

